Subject: Transect polygon design
Message-ID: <Cv3sNN58yR4.6okTAhWwBgAJ@secrgroup.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/secrgroup/c/Cv3sNN58yR4/m/6okTAhWwBgAJ>
